ved_state":{"folders_state":"FOLDERS_STATE_NONE", "folders":[], "permission_mode":"auto", "prompt":"Build a college football rundown for the upcoming week (the games being played from now through the coming Sunday). Today is Monday. This task runs entirely in the cloud. Do NOT use any desktop, local-device, or mcp__remote-devices tools, and do not wait on them. Use web search, web fetch, the Bash tool, and the Gmail tools. Never answer from memory since lines and rankings change constantly.

